  dialogueLines:
  - Howdy fella. *Coughing*
  - 'You got space in that car for a man of the law? *Coughing* '
  - "Well somebody has to be out here killin them zombies\u2026"
  - 'I still have a duty as a law man to protect my neighbourhood. '
  - However I only have *one bullet left*
  - ' gotta keep it in case something bad happens. '
  - 'So what you say? Gonna give this officer a lift? '
  - "Eh, been smokin since my 20s\u2026 Bad habits die hard."
  - 'So what you say? Gonna give this officer a lift? '
  - "You\u2019ll regret this.      "
  - 'Good choice.   '
  - Ill help you if youre ever in trouble.
  - 'Hmm, maybe not, too many folks. '
